{
  "_doc": "The parts kit: every replicant body is composed from these at load time (src/core/bodyRender.ts), 16x20, 14 frames with the same animations as tools/sprites/replicant.json. A copy chooses one variant per part and three colors (traits.body); the visor takes the replicant's feature color (f0 dark, f1 light). Part grids use: b primary, B secondary, c accent, k dark, V/v visor dark/light, W white, '.' empty; a 1px dark outline is added around the whole figure afterwards, so grids hold only the interior. poses: per frame, bob (rows the upper body drops), dx (whole figure shift), and which arm / leg / back pose to draw. Arms and legs are drawn as lines from shoulder / hip to the hand / foot offsets of the pose, so every variant animates without per-frame art.",
